## Checklist

- [ ] `packages/config` exports `loadEnv` + validated base `env`
- [ ] Every `apps/*` has `src/config/` (`env.js` + `index.js`)
- [ ] App code imports `env` only from `./config` or `./config/env`
- [ ] `@repo/config` imported only inside `packages/config` and `apps/*/config/`
- [ ] Resolution order: existing `process.env` → `.env` files → Joi defaults → `.env.example`
- [ ] `dotenv` only when keys missing; `override: false`
- [ ] Root `.env.example` (shared keys) + per-app `.env.example` (app-only keys) — **non-empty** values for required keys
- [ ] README/docs env values copied into plan and `.env.example` when adding keys
- [ ] New/additional env keys registered in project `env.js` + config — § 2c (no raw `process.env`)
- [ ] No raw `process.env.*` outside `packages/config` and `apps/*/config/`
- [ ] Task-complete preview: `PUBLIC_PATH='/qa/{root folder name}' NODE_ENV=production npm run preview` + public `https://imagent.identixweb.com/qa/{root folder name}/api/health`
